WEBVTT

13:04.458 --> 13:05.833
Stay back!

13:13.000 --> 13:15.583
I'm not abandoning you.
I'll stay and fight.

13:26.500 --> 13:28.875
Traitorous elven mage,
from the posters, you're her!

13:33.791 --> 13:35.916
And the wanted Nilfgaardian soldier!

13:37.166 --> 13:38.708
Ba'lian, they're on our side!

13:44.791 --> 13:46.708
Are you going to the Sandpiper?

13:48.791 --> 13:51.583
The Sandpiper is an angel of refuge
to the persecuted.

14:55.208 --> 14:56.708
You're very pretty.

21:06.375 --> 21:07.208
This is important.

22:00.166 --> 22:04.125
There's said to be a pregnant elf
in Cintra.

22:04.208 --> 22:06.291
Think of it, Bal. A new beginning.

22:12.416 --> 22:14.166
Fuck the North!

22:17.625 --> 22:20.583
No. I'm starting anew.

22:20.666 --> 22:24.791
Get a little patch of land,
raise some chickens.

22:24.875 --> 22:28.208
Find a buxom, raven-haired woman

22:28.291 --> 22:32.125
to boss me around.
